id: CTB-SRC0033-r6
source: SRC-0033
section: §3.6
kind: requirement
extends: LXM-REQ-000225
text: By rule R6, owner-reserved decisions (financial policy, release, scope, irreversible data actions, security exceptions and architecture changes) are governed and never guessed: an owner-reserved change needs a recorded decision with its approval, and the gate enforces it.
